%%BeginDocument: ./bilder/fatigue_15.eps
%!PS-Adobe-2.0 EPSF-1.2
%%Creator: MATLAB, The Mathworks, Inc.
%%Title: ../bilder/fatigue_15.eps
%%CreationDate: 07/03/ 0  17:28:24
